# 🛍️ `services/dnk_shopify`: Architecture Audit & SOTA Donor Roadmap

## 1. Domain Positioning & Canonical Role (Core Workhorse)
Per **AGENTS.md Rule 8**, `services/dnk_shopify` is one of the **3 Canonical Core Workhorses** of DNK OS (alongside `services/dnk_media` and `services/dnk_distribution`). It serves as the unified **Store Fleet, Deployment Gateway, Theme AST Transpiler & Conversion Studio**.

### Active Capabilities (Verified in Codebase):
- **Canonical Themes SSOT**: `DNK-e.com/` and `DNK_Horizon_Tinker/` (Shopify Theme OS 2.0 with 107 blocks, 307 snippets, 137 sections, Polaris design tokens).
- **Theme AST & Mechanical Transpiler**: `shopify_liquid/canvas_to_liquid_transpiler.py`, `studio/engine/mechanical_transpiler.py`, `shopify_vite_pipeline.py`.
